  <data name="Faq1A" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>An escrow service holds funds securely until all agreed conditions are met. Neither the buyer nor the seller can access the funds until the transaction terms are fulfilled.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Faq1Q" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>What is an escrow service?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Faq2A" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Most transactions complete within 24-72 hours after both parties confirm the terms. Our system processes fund releases instantly once approved.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Faq2Q" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>How long does a transaction take?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Faq3A" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Our fees are transparent and competitive. We charge a small percentage per transaction with no hidden costs. Contact us for volume-based pricing.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Faq3Q" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>What are the fees?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Faq4A" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Absolutely. We use bank-grade AES-256 encryption and are PCI DSS compliant. Your funds are held in segregated accounts with full insurance coverage.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Faq4Q" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Is my money safe?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Faq5A" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Transactions can be cancelled if both parties agree. In case of disputes, our mediation team will assist in resolving the matter fairly.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Faq5Q" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Can I cancel a transaction?</value>
  </data>
  <data name="Subtitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Everything you need to know about our escrow service.</value>
  </data>
